# VolleyLab

Read `AGENTS.md` and `project-context.md` before non-trivial work.

- Backend rules live in services and pure modules (`formations/`, `tactic-rules.ts`, `event-rules.ts`, `statistics.ts`), not controllers.
- Court coordinates: x 0..9, y 0..18; keep backend DTOs and frontend `Court` in sync.
- Teams: shared read, owner write. Matches: anyone can view; only owner edits events/lineups/scores.
- Tactics use formation **slots**, not player ids; play rules checked in `validatePlay` on `/tactics/:id/validate`.
- Prefer minimal diffs; add a unit test when changing business rules.
- Do not add physics/ML/microservices unless explicitly requested.